# ...except the gauntlet's CMake file, which this rule hid from the repository
# (the root CMakeLists.txt add_subdirectory()s it; found missing 2026-09-26)
!/gauntlet/CMakeLists.txt
# the gauntlet's tools as build.py leaves them beside their sources on Linux
# (no .exe suffix there)
/gauntlet/bench_1d_vs_mkl
/gauntlet/bench_1d_vs_fftw
/gauntlet/recal_1d_probe
/gauntlet/k1_fwd_ref_probe

# Generated wisdom files are committed — single source of truth, one folder,
# visible to everyone (spike/rfft/c2r/bluestein/oop). Keep all wisdoms here.
!src/dag-fft-compiler/generator/generated/*.txt

# Refactor-safety baseline artifacts are COMMITTED — they are the reference the
# migration diffs against, so an ignored baseline means the harness reports green
# on nothing. See docs/design/refactor_safety_harness.md.
!src/tools/baseline/reference/
!src/tools/baseline/reference/**

# Schedule-search experiment sandbox — local-only, NEVER committed to the repo.
# Throwaway codelets, benches, and search drivers live here so experiments
# can't leak into production (see docs/roadmap/schedule_search_plan.md).
/src/dag-fft-compiler/experiments/
/docs/research
/src/dag-fft-compiler/jit/generated
docs/roadmap/cascade_natural_inplace_plan.md

# owner 2026-09-07: design comparison notes kept local
docs/design/cascade_vs_mkl_method.md
docs/design/cascade_zturn_t_plan.md
docs/design/sub2048_campaign_article.md
docs/design/zturn_t_ship_plan.md

# owner design contracts (local, never committed)
docs/design/design_contracts.md
docs/design/pow2_race_pools.md
docs/design/exact_trig_constants.md

# The gauntlet's runs live in gauntlet/results/ (the standing runs are tracked: the
# csv rows are the record; store/*.txt and *.log stay ignored by the rules above).

# The wisdom store lives in src/wisdom/ (2026-09-24): the shards and the per-host
# subtrees are tracked there; the global *.txt ignore above must not swallow them.
!src/wisdom/**/*.txt
# The merge writes a backup beside each shard (gauntlet merge); backups are local, never tracked.
src/wisdom/**/*.bak_pre_merge_*
# The store lock: an OS lock file every store directory keeps (wisdom2.h); never tracked.
src/wisdom/**/wisdom2.lock

# the KFR comparator DLL build.py --kfr copies beside the bench: the user's own KFR, GPLv2/commercial, never committed
gauntlet/kfr_capi.dll

# Prototype/harness scratch: local only, never tracked
# ...except the AVX-512 tail-policy study's harness (owner, 2026-09-28): the
# evidence behind policy law L10. Git cannot re-include a file below an
# excluded folder, so the rule opens one level at a time.
docs/roadmap/zil_avx512_prototypes/*
!docs/roadmap/zil_avx512_prototypes/harness/
docs/roadmap/zil_avx512_prototypes/harness/*
!docs/roadmap/zil_avx512_prototypes/harness/tail_policy/
!docs/roadmap/zil_avx512_prototypes/harness/tail_policy/**
build_tuned/REDISTRIBUTION.md
